    "Each account gets 5 starter replies, then each reply costs 20 coins. AI is used when available; otherwise replies come from prepared style guides. You confirm each paid reply. Failed or canceled replies cost nothing, and clearing chat does not reset the allowance.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each account gets 5 starter replies, then each reply costs 20 coins. AI is used when available; otherwise replies come from prepared style guides. You confirm each paid reply. Failed or canceled replies cost nothing, and clearing chat does not reset the allowance."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada cuenta tiene 5 respuestas gratis; después cuestan 20 monedas. Se usa IA si está disponible o guías preparadas. Cada pago requiere confirmación. Fallos y cancelaciones no cuestan; borrar el chat no reinicia la cuota."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque compte reçoit 5 réponses gratuites, puis chaque réponse coûte 20 pièces. L’IA est utilisée si disponible, sinon des guides préparés. Chaque paiement est confirmé. Échecs et annulations sont gratuits ; effacer le chat ne réinitialise pas le quota."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各アカウントは最初の5回が無料で、その後は1回20コインです。AI が利用できなければ用意されたガイドを使います。有料返信は毎回確認が必要です。失敗やキャンセルは無料で、会話の消去で無料枠は戻りません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个账号有 5 次免费回复，之后每次 20 金币。优先使用 AI，否则提供预制搭配指南。每次付费均需确认，失败或取消不扣费，清空聊天不会重置额度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each check-in adds 10 activity points. Every 100 points adds one level. Your balance and level update across the app.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each check-in adds 10 activity points. Every 100 points adds one level. Your balance and level update across the app."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada registro suma 10 puntos. Cada 100 puntos subes un nivel. Tu saldo y nivel se actualizan en toda la app."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque visite rapporte 10 points. Tous les 100 points, vous gagnez un niveau. Le solde et le niveau sont synchronisés dans l’app."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "チェックインで10ポイントを獲得し、100ポイントごとにレベルが上がります。残高とレベルはアプリ全体で更新されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次打卡获得 10 活跃积分，每 100 积分升一级。余额与等级全局同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
