    "Every coin purchase shows a confirmation and your remaining balance. If you need more coins, Get Coins opens without deducting anything. Gift delivery is currently unavailable; collectibles remain yours to wear.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every coin purchase shows a confirmation and your remaining balance. If you need more coins, Get Coins opens without deducting anything. Gift delivery is currently unavailable; collectibles remain yours to wear."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada compra muestra una confirmación y el saldo restante. Si necesitas monedas, se abre la tienda sin descontar nada. El envío de regalos no está disponible; puedes lucir tus objetos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque achat affiche une confirmation et votre solde restant. Si nécessaire, la boutique s’ouvre sans déduction. L’envoi de cadeaux est indisponible ; vos objets restent disponibles à porter."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "コイン使用時には確認と残高が表示されます。不足時はコイン購入画面を開くだけで、引き落としはありません。ギフト送信は現在利用できませんが、アイテムは自分で使えます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "金币消费会展示确认与剩余余额。余额不足时可进入获取金币页，不会直接扣费。礼物赠送暂不可用，收藏品仍可自行佩戴。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
