    "Open the more menu on a profile, post, photo, or comment to report the exact item or block its author. Reports and block choices are saved on this device. Reported content is hidden immediately; blocking a member also hides their rooms, posts and chats.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open the more menu on a profile, post, photo, or comment to report the exact item or block its author. Reports and block choices are saved on this device. Reported content is hidden immediately; blocking a member also hides their rooms, posts and chats."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abre el menú de un perfil, publicación, foto o comentario para reportarlo o bloquear al autor. Se guarda en este dispositivo. El contenido reportado se oculta al instante; bloquear también oculta sus salas, publicaciones y chats."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrez le menu d’un profil, d’une publication, d’une photo ou d’un commentaire pour le signaler ou bloquer l’auteur. Les choix sont enregistrés sur cet appareil. Le contenu signalé est masqué immédiatement ; le blocage masque aussi salons, publications et discussions."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "プロフィール、投稿、写真、コメントのメニューから通報や作者のブロックができます。設定はこの端末に保存されます。通報した内容はすぐ非表示になり、ブロックすると相手のルーム、投稿、チャットも非表示になります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在主页、动态、照片或评论的更多菜单中举报具体内容或拉黑作者。记录保存在本设备，举报内容立即隐藏，拉黑后也会隐藏该用户的房间、动态和聊天。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
