    "This deletes this device's account, profile, photos, looks, conversations, and wallet records. This cannot be undone. No remote account is connected.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This deletes this device's account, profile, photos, looks, conversations, and wallet records. This cannot be undone. No remote account is connected."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se eliminarán de este dispositivo tu cuenta, perfil, fotos, looks, conversaciones y registros de cartera. No se puede deshacer. No hay una cuenta remota conectada."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le compte, le profil, les photos, les looks, les conversations et les données du portefeuille seront supprimés de cet appareil. Cette action est irréversible. Aucun compte distant n’est connecté."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この端末のアカウント、プロフィール、写真、投稿、会話、ウォレット記録を削除します。元に戻せません。クラウドアカウントは接続されていません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这将删除本设备上的账号、资料、照片、动态、聊天和钱包记录，且无法恢复。当前未连接云端账号。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
